    {
        id: "tool.child-handles-std-only",
        kind: 3,
        layer: "tool",
        since: "0.2.24-dev",
        gate: "alpha",
        diagnostics: [],
        fix: "工具链 runProcess、procSpawn、procSpawnLimited 的子进程只得到标准输入、输出、错误（procSpawn 另加调试控制通道），本进程其余的文件、套接字、管道一律不继承，不论是否设了 CLOEXEC 或可继承标志（同 Python 的 close_fds、Go 的句柄白名单）；此前 Windows 继承全部可继承句柄，Linux、macOS 只靠 CLOEXEC。要交给子进程的数据经标准输入输出、文件或命令行参数传递",
        applicability: "unavailable",
        before: "const s = tcpListen(8080) catch -1; runProcess(\"cmd.exe\", [\"/c\", \"start /b server.exe\"], \"\") catch -1; tcpClose(s); // Windows 上后台进程曾拿着 8080",
        after: "const s = tcpListen(8080) catch -1; runProcess(\"cmd.exe\", [\"/c\", \"start /b server.exe\"], \"\") catch -1; tcpClose(s); // 子进程只拿到标准三件，8080 随 tcpClose 释放",
        implementedIn: "D3 v0.40",
